stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Booked : cash on pickup, booking validated (P31, P32)
    [*] --> PendingPayment : online payments, coming soon (P31)

    PendingPayment --> Booked : payment captured (P32)
    PendingPayment --> Cancelled : payment fails / traveler cancels
    PendingPayment --> Expired : payment window elapses

    Booked --> Dropped : partner verifies check-in QR/OTP (P33)
    Booked --> Cancelled : traveler, partner or admin cancels
    Booked --> Expired : slot window elapses with no drop-off

    Dropped --> Stored : drop-off photo captured & recorded (P34)
    Dropped --> Cancelled : admin cancels (dispute)

    Stored --> PickedUp : partner verifies retrieval QR/OTP (P35)
    Stored --> Cancelled : admin cancels (dispute)

    PickedUp --> Completed : cash collected, 15% fee recorded (P4)

    Cancelled --> [*] : refund only for online payments
    Expired --> [*] : refund only for online payments
    Completed --> [*]

    note right of Booked
        Booking Fulfillment Time (BFT) is measured
        from search start to entry into Booked.
    end note

    note right of Stored
        Photographic handoff proof is attached
        to the drop-off record here.
    end note
